{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13473","headline":"河中晚霁 · 韦建","name":"河中晚霁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖广舟自轻，江天欲澄霁。\n是时清楚望，气色犹霾曀。\n踯蹰金霞白，波上日初丽。\n烟红落镜中，树木生天际。\n杳杳涯欲斑，蒙蒙云复闭。\n言垂星汉明，又覩寰瀛势。\n微兴从此惬，悠然不知岁。\n试歌沧浪清，遂觉乾坤细。\n肯念客衣薄，将期永投袂。\n迟回渔父间，一雁声嘹唳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13473.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13473","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}